 "text": "The repository's lesson zero two records a before and after run: node A's proxy accepts connections and never answers for twenty seconds while the gateway serves three hundred reads per second. Before the timeouts, in-flight requests peaked at eleven thirty, goroutines at forty-six fifty, and none of node A's failures came back as a five oh four. After, in-flight peaked at one forty-nine, goroutines at six thirty-two, and ninety-nine point four percent of them did. These numbers are quoted from the lesson file at the v one hardened commit; they cover the whole lesson zero two patch, and this video did not re-run the experiment.",
